{"batchcomplete":"","query":{"pages":{"17735495":{"pageid":17735495,"ns":6,"title":"File:Boonlee89's home studio.jpg","index":1,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":1385968,"width":2715,"height":4096,"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2f/Boonlee89%27s_home_studio.jpg/960px-Boonlee89%27s_home_studio.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":640,"thumbheight":966,"responsiveUrls":{"2":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2f/Boonlee89%27s_home_studio.jpg/1280px-Boonlee89%27s_home_studio.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail"},"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2f/Boonlee89%27s_home_studio.jpg/960px-Boonlee89%27s_home_studio.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":640,"height":966,"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2f/Boonlee89%27s_home_studio.jpg/1280px-Boonlee89%27s_home_studio.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail 2x"},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2f/Boonlee89%27s_home_studio.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Boonlee89%27s_home_studio.jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=17735495","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"<p>My Studio\n</p><p>Where the magic happens. I'm a student on a tight budget and I have collected these items over time. What used to be webcam and cheap microphones have evolved to what I'm capable of putting out today - HD quality videos shot with my sturdy D5000 and mint audio quality captured by the CAD u37 Condenser Microphone. It's a fun experience to play with home recording because you get the liberty to create whatever your creativity allows you to.\n</p><p>List of equipments and softwares:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Acoustic Guitar: Rogue Acoustic Guitar</li>\n<li>Electric Guitar: \u00a0 Epiphone LP Junior Special Electric Guitar</li>\n<li>Amp:\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Rogue G10 10W 1x3.5 Guitar Combo Amp</li>\n<li>Keyboard:\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Casio WK-200</li>\n<li>Midi Controller: \u00a0 ION Discover Keyboard USB</li>\n<li>Microphone:\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 CAD u37 Condenser Microphone</li>\n<li>Camera: \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Nikon D5000</li>\n<li>Recording Software:\u00a0 Sony Vegas Pro, Audacity</li>\n<li>Video Editing Software:\u00a0 Windows Movie Maker, MAGIX Movie Edit Pro</li></ul>\n<p>My Youtube Channel\n</p>\n<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/boonleemusic\">https://www.youtube.com/boonleemusic</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2011-07-30 11:59","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/people/45429009@N03\">Alexis Fam</a> from Madison, United States","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY 2.0","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""}}}]},"41525418":{"pageid":41525418,"ns":6,"title":"File:David Jones' entry of a radio float in a procession, c. 1930s, by Sam Hood (6960878263).jpg","index":2,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":260689,"width":1400,"height":1065,"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e6/David_Jones%27_entry_of_a_radio_float_in_a_procession%2C_c._1930s%2C_by_Sam_Hood_%286960878263%29.jpg/960px-David_Jones%27_entry_of_a_radio_float_in_a_procession%2C_c._1930s%2C_by_Sam_Hood_%286960878263%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":640,"thumbheight":487,"responsiveUrls":{"2":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e6/Davi